  "description": "<p><span style=\"font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">At Emtress Hair, a New York based company, we aim to offer quality products to help you care for your wigs and hair extensions. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">One of the best ways to care for your wigs and hair extensions is to properly store your hair.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">Our hair extensions and wig storage bags are made with care. We have greatly minimized the use of plastic which can be bad for hair over time, and trap odors. Instead, we have maximized the use of soft satin fabrics to protect your wig or hair extensions.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"> In addition to our bags, we have a great selection of  wig and extension products and accessories to help you style and maintain your tresses.</span></p><div><br></div><p><span style=\"font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><br></span>                                                </p>",
